# Prettier does not understand MkDocs Material syntax and rewrites it into
# something that no longer renders.
#
# The specific failure: admonition bodies ("!!! info", "!!! tip") must be
# indented by four spaces to belong to the block. Prettier reformats the
# markdown table or list inside them and strips that indent, which silently
# moves the content outside the admonition. Blocks have been de-indented by
# format-on-save more than once.
#
# Interface documentation is authored for MkDocs, not for Prettier, so it is
# excluded wholesale.

**/docs/**/*.md
